<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-LEADING TOUR OF CORSICA PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING TOUR OF CORSICA PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AJACCIO, Corsica 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>Tour of Corsica world championship rally after two timed stages</p>
<p>on Monday:</p>
<p>1. Gilles Panizzi (France) Peugeot 306  31 minutes 26 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Francois Delecour (France) Peugeot 306	 31:32</p>
<p>  3. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza	   31:39</p>
<p>  4 equal. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza    31:42</p>
<p>  4 equal. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford Escort	 31:42</p>
<p>  6. Tommi Makinen (Finland) Mitsubishi Lancer    31:43</p>
<p>  7. Philippe Bugalski (France) Renault Megane    31:58</p>
<p>  8. Serge Jordan (France) Renault Megane	   32:18</p>
<p>  9. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Ford Escort	    32:22</p>
<p> 10. Uwe Nittel (Germany) Mitsubishi Lancer	 32:45</p>
</text>
